      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is one thing outlined in my own report: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1010-blocked-users-can-still-see-hear-you-detailed\nIt's a little more nuanced than that by the way. If the party that blocked you was in the room first, you'll be able to see them in the social menu, and you may even be able to see/hear them!\nHowever, if they joined *after* you, you'll be blocked correctly and furthermore you won't even see them in the social menu. You'll still probably be able to find their player capsule in the room with your pointer though (which is something that's been a thing for ages).\nBehavior should be normal for people who conduct the blocking though. It used to be worse in that the blocker could even hear the blockee (build 1004), but that has been fixed. Now it's just the blockee seeing/hearing the blocker. If it bothers you then just block them back for now, that's what I had to do for a little while myself.\nConfirmed still present in 1017, but I've been told a fix is in the works.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-15T22:19:02.330Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "when your in the room with someone who blocked you, you can't see them in the \"in room\" section of the social menu anymore.\nbut the person who blocked you can still see you in the \"in room\" section of the social menu.\n\nEDIT:\nafter some more research I noticed that you can still see the person who blocked you in your quick menu.\nthe build is : 1010",
